{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/What_is_peggy_s_farm.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a <strong>Peggle</strong> player, a<strong> cozy</strong> gamer, or a supporter of all things <strong>indie</strong>, you won't be able to put it down.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the non-stop, ball-bouncing fun of Pachinko mixed with the cozy and satisfying gameplay of farming sims like <strong>Stardew Valley</strong> and <strong>Harvest Moon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Cloud_shapeTractor_Pic.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Store_Watering.gif?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear out space and collect materials with your <strong>pinball cannon</strong>. Watering your plants? Use your cannon for that! Taking care of animals? Your cannon does that too! Your fluffy friends love to bounce around that cannonball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the most out of the day by lining up those<strong> trick shot</strong> ricochets. Then <strong>aim and fire</strong> your ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Cloud_Town.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Bountiful! This small town is vibrant and alive, and there are <strong>mysteries</strong> to unravel! After a long day of farming call in a little favor with the carpenter or the blacksmith\u2014 now you can\u00a0stop by the <strong>sawmill</strong> or delve into the <strong>mines</strong> to mix things up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Mini_games_graphic.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have arrived as hired help, but as you get to know your new small town, you'll find you're a perfect fit here. Bountiful townsfolk are full of personality, see who you connect with as you become one of the townsfolk too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">v<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Chibi-Gif.gif?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2668780?t=1743477068","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2668780?t=1743477068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743477068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743477068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2803620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/What_is_peggy_s_farm.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a <strong>Peggle</strong> player, a<strong> cozy</strong> gamer, or a supporter of all things <strong>indie</strong>, you won't be able to put it down.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the non-stop, ball-bouncing fun of Pachinko mixed with the cozy and satisfying gameplay of farming sims like <strong>Stardew Valley</strong> and <strong>Harvest Moon.</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Cloud_shapeTractor_Pic.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Store_Watering.gif?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear out space and collect materials with your <strong>pinball cannon</strong>. Watering your plants? Use your cannon for that! Taking care of animals? Your cannon does that too! Your fluffy friends love to bounce around that cannonball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the most out of the day by lining up those<strong> trick shot</strong> ricochets. Then <strong>aim and fire</strong> your ball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Cloud_Town.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Bountiful! This small town is vibrant and alive, and there are <strong>mysteries</strong> to unravel! After a long day of farming call in a little favor with the carpenter or the blacksmith\u2014 now you can\u00a0stop by the <strong>sawmill</strong> or delve into the <strong>mines</strong> to mix things up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Mini_games_graphic.png?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may have arrived as hired help, but as you get to know your new small town, you'll find you're a perfect fit here. Bountiful townsfolk are full of personality, see who you connect with as you become one of the townsfolk too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">v<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/extras/Chibi-Gif.gif?t=1743477068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Fowers Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668780/header.jpg?t=1743477068","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120490,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120490/movie480.mp4?t=1743424885","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120490/movie_max.mp4?t=1743424885"},"name":"Kickstarter v1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120490/eb16d9c2881221e2166df02a5be5be50cda3c323/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743424885","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120490/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743424885","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120490/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743424885"}}],"name":"Peggy's Farm","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 9+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10 and Windows 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Fowers Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany"